{"id":"carre_ment","lemma":"carrément","pos":"adv","rank":1892,"glosses":["really, completely","straight out, bluntly (of asking, speaking etc.)","right, slap-bang, smack-dab"],"ipa":"/ka.ʁe.mɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/4a/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-carr%C3%A9ment.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-carr%C3%A9ment.wav.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Cela semble carrément impossible.","en":"It seems totally impossible.","words":[{"g":"that"},{"g":"to seem","l":"sembler"},null,{"g":"impossible"}]},{"text":"C'est carrément dangereux.","en":"That's downright dangerous.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,{"g":"dangerous"}]},{"text":"C'était juste carrément idiot.","en":"That was just plain stupid.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"fair, just"},null,{"g":"idiotic"}]},{"text":"Elle passe carrément trop de temps à surfer sur le web.","en":"She spends way too much time surfing the web.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"to pass","l":"passer"},null,null,null,{"g":"time"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"to surf"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"the / it"},null],"phrases":[[3,5,"excessive,"]]},{"text":"Elle passe carrément trop de temps à naviguer sur la toile.","en":"She spends way too much time surfing the web.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"to pass","l":"passer"},null,null,null,{"g":"time"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"to navigate"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"fabric, cloth"}],"phrases":[[3,5,"excessive,"]]}]}